mapping "V8253.1" source="V8253" target="213770003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8253 = SNOMED CT 213770003 36198007 (Swedish extension of ICD-10 V82.5, refined with
        activity context). The base ICD-10 code V82.5 has Athena crosswalk SNOMED CT 213770003 (Railway
        accident) and 36198007 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). The Swedish activity
        qualifier has no standard SNOMED CT encoding, so the target subsumes the source on the
        accident-type axis while losing the activity attribute. for the primary railway-accident target:
        verified Athena crosswalk from the parent code, one-level broader. 36198007 secondary broader at
        (also crosswalk-verified but more generic).
        """
}
